{"seq":2,"slug":"throughput-latency-capacity","title":"吞吐、延迟与容量工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/document-pdf-label-generation-engineering/scale-generation-pipeline-ops/throughput-latency-capacity","wordCount":3158,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"吞吐-延迟与容量工程\">吞吐、延迟与容量工程</h1><p>一批 12 万张面单要在 40 分钟内打完交给分拣线，另一头客服在后台点「重新下载发票」期望两秒内拿到 PDF。两件事共用同一个渲染服务，却对「快」给出完全不同的定义：前者要<strong>稳定吞吐</strong>（每秒完成多少张、多快清空积压），后者要<strong>请求延迟</strong>（单次调用的 p50/p99）。把两者混成一个「响应时间」指标去调优，结果通常是给批量任务加了更多 worker，却让交互式下载的 p99 更差——因为两类负载争抢的是同一种稀缺资源：CPU 与内存。这篇文档处理的就是这条线：如何量化、核算并守住生成管线的吞吐、延迟与容量边界。</p>\n<p>异构负载的冲突由渲染引擎的物理特性决定（见 <a href=\"../rendering-architecture-html-to-pdf/headless-render-engine-architecture\">无头渲染引擎架构</a>）：一次 Chromium print 是几十到几百毫秒的重 CPU 操作，而 ZPL 文本是微秒级内存拼装（见 <a href=\"../barcode-shipping-label-zpl/barcode-symbology-encoding\">条码符号与编码</a>），两类工作的容量模型必须分开核算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要把「快」讲清楚，先得把它的四个维度拆开，否则所有指标都会互相污染。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>延迟（latency）</strong>：单次生成从入队到返回文件所经历的墙钟时间，按分位数看（p50 / p95 / p99 / p999）而非平均值。PDF 生成是典型重尾分布，平均值几乎没有决策价值。</li>\n<li><strong>吞吐（throughput）</strong>：单位时间完成的文档数（docs/s 或 labels/min），是稳态速率，与瞬时延迟不矛盾——高延迟的批量 worker 可以同时拥有很高的吞吐。</li>\n<li><strong>并发度（concurrency in flight）</strong>：任一时刻正在进行中的生成任务数，是连接延迟与吞吐的中间量。</li>\n<li><strong>容量（capacity）</strong>：在满足延迟目标的前提下集群能承载的最大到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即「峰值 QPS 下的安全水位」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的关系由**小定律（Little&#39;s Law）**锁定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是系统内在制品数（in-flight concurrency），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是到达率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均停留时间。最实用的推论是：<strong>给定延迟目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 和峰值到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，系统必须能同时容纳 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 个在制品</strong>。该式不假设到达与服务分布，也不在乎调度算法，因此是容量核算的起点而非近似。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求到达 λ] --&gt; B[接入层&lt;br/&gt;限流 / 鉴权]&#10;    B --&gt; C{有界队列&lt;br/&gt;等待 Wq}&#10;    C --&gt; D[渲染 worker 池&lt;br/&gt;服务时间 S]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Chromium print&lt;br/&gt;CPU 重]&#10;    D --&gt; F[ZPL 拼装&lt;br/&gt;CPU 轻]&#10;    E --&gt; G[产物存储&lt;br/&gt;PDF / PNG]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[下载 / 推送]&#10;    C -.背压 503.-&gt; I[拒绝或降级]&#10;    E -.池冷启动.-&gt; J[预热池]\">graph TD\n    A[请求到达 λ] --&gt; B[接入层&lt;br/&gt;限流 / 鉴权]\n    B --&gt; C{有界队列&lt;br/&gt;等待 Wq}\n    C --&gt; D[渲染 worker 池&lt;br/&gt;服务时间 S]\n    D --&gt; E[Chromium print&lt;br/&gt;CPU 重]\n    D --&gt; F[ZPL 拼装&lt;br/&gt;CPU 轻]\n    E --&gt; G[产物存储&lt;br/&gt;PDF / PNG]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[下载 / 推送]\n    C -.背压 503.-&gt; I[拒绝或降级]\n    E -.池冷启动.-&gt; J[预热池]</pre><p>必须把「队列等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」与「服务时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>」分开埋点：p99 恶化时第一个要回答的问题是「排队排久了，还是渲染变慢了」，而这两个原因的处置方式完全相反（前者扩容，后者查引擎/模板）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>p99 渲染延迟</td>\n<td>99% 请求低于该值</td>\n<td>交互式：1–3 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定吞吐</td>\n<td>稳态完成速率</td>\n<td>批量：数千张/分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>入队到开跑</td>\n<td>峰值 &lt; 2 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在制品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>并发中任务数</td>\n<td>≤ 池容量 × 0.8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"吞吐模型与小定律容量核算\">吞吐模型与小定律容量核算</h2><p>先把一次生成的<strong>服务时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 测出来，这是所有容量核算的输入。它必须按模板类别分层测量，因为渲染成本差异极大：ZPL 面单（纯文本 + 条码指令）约 0.2–2 ms，单页发票 PDF（无图）约 40–120 ms（Chromium layout + print），多页带图 PDF/A 约 300 ms–2 s（图片解码 + 字体嵌入 + 子集化），含签名或加密的再加 50–300 ms（密码学运算 + 证书链验证）。</p>\n<p>容量核算第一步是单机吞吐上限：一台 8 vCPU 机器，若渲染一份发票耗 80 ms CPU（约 1 核占用），理论单机吞吐约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.08</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 / 0.08 = 12.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/0.08</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.5</span></span></span></span></span> docs/s，但这是忽略排队、GC、冷启动的乐观上界，真实稳定工作点要除以安全系数（通常取 2–3），得到 4–6 docs/s/机。第二步用 Little&#39;s Law 反推并发度：若峰值到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> docs/s、目标平均停留时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> s，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 300 \\times 0.5 = 150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 个在制品。单 worker 一次只处理 1 个任务就需要 150 个 worker；用共享浏览器 + 多 page 时按每实例可并行 page 数折算，但 Chromium 的多 page 会争抢同一渲染线程与 GPU 进程，实测单实例并行数超过 4–8 后单任务延迟反而上升——这是必须实测而非推算的拐点。</p>\n<p>第三步才是排队论给出的「为什么不能跑满」。对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个并行服务台、到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、单个服务率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = 1/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{\\lambda}{c\\mu} = \\frac{\\lambda S}{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3612em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">μ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，排队等待近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q \\approx \\frac{\\rho}{1-\\rho} \\cdot \\frac{S}{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2286em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。真正要命的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\rho}{1-\\rho}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2286em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>：利用率从 0.5 升到 0.8，等待时间翻 4 倍；从 0.8 升到 0.95，再翻约 4 倍。<strong>所以按平均负载的 100% 配容量，等价于让 p99 无限大</strong>。生产系统的常规工作点是峰值利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\le 0.6\\text{–}0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span>，这也是为什么「算出来 6 台够用」最终应部署 9–10 台。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渲染延迟的分层预算与-p99-归因\">渲染延迟的分层预算与 p99 归因</h2><p>延迟不能只报一个总数，要拆成可归因的分层预算：排队等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（0–2000 ms，受利用率与调度影响，不可并行）、数据获取（5–80 ms，可与渲染 prep 重叠，受下游 DB/API 抖动影响）、模板编译与变量注入（2–20 ms）、浏览器上下文创建（5–150 ms，冷启动 vs 复用 context）、渲染 + print（40 ms–2 s，受页面复杂度、字体、图片影响，不可并行）、后处理如 PDF/A 转换/签名/压缩（50–500 ms）、存储写入与签名 URL（10–100 ms）。</p>\n<p>两个最容易被低估的膨胀源：</p>\n<p><strong>其一是冷启动。</strong> 每次生成都新建 Chromium 进程，成本是 500 ms–3 s 的固定开销，这让 p99 直接翻好几倍。生产做法是维护一个<strong>预热池</strong>：进程启动后先加载一次空白页并保持存活，任务来了复用其 browser context（或 page），只在池容量不足时才付出冷启动代价。</p>\n<p><strong>尾延迟会乘法放大。</strong> 一次请求顺序经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个阶段，每阶段「不慢」的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则端到端都快的概率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_{i=1}^{n} p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。若每阶段 p99 为 10 ms（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = 0.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span>），7 个阶段后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.99</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.932</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.99^7 \\approx 0.932</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.932</span></span></span></span></span>——<strong>每段都在 99 分位内，合起来只有 93 分位达标</strong>。这是分布式生成管线 p99 超标的常见根因：不是某一段特别慢，而是阶段太多。对策是减少串行阶段数（把数据获取与上下文预热重叠）并给关键路径设预算。</p>\n<p>归因时的两个必备探针：<strong>事件循环延迟</strong>（Chromium 是单线程事件循环，被大图解码阻塞会让所有并发 page 一起变慢）和<strong>队列等待的独立分布</strong>（与渲染时间分位数对照，一眼看出该扩容还是该查引擎）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量规划与弹性伸缩\">容量规划与弹性伸缩</h2><p>容量规划的目标不是「够用」，而是「在峰值 + 故障域丢失下仍满足延迟目标」。核算顺序是：峰值到达率 → 单任务服务时间 → 并发度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> → 折算实例数 → 加安全系数 → 加 N+1 冗余。</p>\n<p>各资源的扩展性质不同：<strong>CPU 核数</strong>随吞吐近似线性增长，但受超线程争抢与共享 GPU 进程影响，扩容信号是利用率持续 &gt;65%；<strong>内存</strong>按 worker 数 × 单实例常驻（Chromium 单实例 150–500 MB，复杂页面陡增）增长，信号是 OOM kill；<strong>预热池</strong>按「峰值并发 × 冷启动/服务时间」定，池过小即退化为冷启动；<strong>对象存储带宽</strong>随产物字节数增长，信号是写入 p99；<strong>队列深度</strong>是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda - \\mu c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的积分，深度无界即延迟无界。</p>\n<p><strong>弹性伸缩的触发指标必须选队列深度或队列等待，而不是 CPU。</strong> CPU 是滞后指标：等它打满时队列已经积压，扩容生效（镜像拉取 + 进程 + 浏览器预热）还要几十秒到几分钟，这段窗口里延迟已经崩了。按「队列深度 / 目标每 worker 速率」预测所需副本数，才能把扩容做在延迟恶化之前。</p>\n<p>冷启动时间决定了弹性伸缩的<strong>最小可行响应时间</strong>。若扩容一个实例从调度到可服务需要 60 s，而峰值是 30 s 内的突发，横向扩容根本来不及——此时只能靠<strong>预留 + 预热</strong>：把常态容量按接近峰值配置，再用队列削峰。突发的时间尺度小于扩容的时间尺度时，弹性是无效的。成本也主要花在 CPU 与内存常驻占用（而非存储，面单 PDF 仅几十到一百多 KB），所以降本的第一杠杆是提高单实例利用率（预热复用、模板复杂度治理），把预热池压小只会让冷启动把成本换个形式还回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"背压-隔离与降级\">背压、隔离与降级</h2><p>当负载超过容量时，系统必须在三种失败中主动选一种：<strong>排队到延迟爆炸</strong>、<strong>拒绝请求</strong>、<strong>降级输出</strong>。默认（无背压）行为就是第一种，且有最坏的性质——延迟无界增长，客户端超时重试，重试又放大负载，直到级联崩溃。</p>\n<p><strong>有界队列是第一道防线。</strong> 队列必须有明确上界，超过上界直接返回 <code>429 Too Many Requests</code>（配合 <code>Retry-After</code>）或 <code>503</code>。一个无界队列不是「缓冲」，它只是把崩溃的时间推迟并放大。</p>\n<p><strong>按负载类别隔离 worker 池是第二道防线。</strong> 交互式下载与批量打印绝不能共用同一个队列，否则一批 12 万张的任务会把交互式请求饿死。做法是划分优先级队列，或物理隔离成两组 worker：交互式池小而预热充分、按 p99 调度、拒绝激进；批量池大、容忍长延迟、按吞吐调度、可被抢占。优先级队列要防止<strong>饥饿</strong>：给低优先级任务设置老化（aging，等待越久优先级越高），否则持续的高优流量会让批量任务永不执行。</p>\n<p><strong>降级是第三道防线，且必须在设计期定义好输出。</strong> 常见选项：跳过非必需的 PDF/A 转换（先出普通 PDF，异步补合规版本）、降低图片 DPI、跳过非关键的可访问性标签、把同步下载改为「生成后推送链接」，以及 ZPL 直出而非先出 PDF 再转。哪些能降、降了会不会违反承运商或合规要求（例如 PDF/A 是存档刚需、面单条码 DPI 有承运商下限），必须由业务规则决定，不能由运维临场拍板。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等与去重是背压的隐形前提。</strong> 客户端超时重试几乎必然发生，若没有幂等键，一次超时会变成两次渲染。用 <code>(templateId, orderId, version)</code> 这类确定性缓存键，让重试命中已有产物或进行中的任务（future 合并），既抵消重试放大，也把重复渲染的成本从算力里彻底删掉。最后，<strong>熔断冷启动</strong>：池容量耗尽、每个任务都要等冷启动时，宁可快速失败也不要让请求排进一条几分钟才能消化的队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>延迟和吞吐是两套指标，必须分开核算；连接二者的是小定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>，它给出「给定延迟目标与峰值到达率，系统要容纳多少在制品」。</li>\n<li>排队论里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\rho}{1-\\rho}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2286em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的爆炸是容量规划的核心约束：峰值利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\le 0.6\\text{–}0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span>，按 100% 配容量等于放弃 p99。</li>\n<li>端到端 p99 是各阶段达标概率的乘积，阶段越多越容易超标；减少串行阶段比单点优化更有效。</li>\n<li>冷启动（Chromium 进程启动）与事件循环阻塞是两个最大的尾延迟来源，靠预热池与实测并行数上限治理，不能靠推算。</li>\n<li>弹性伸缩要按队列深度而非 CPU 触发；突发时间尺度小于扩容时间尺度时弹性无效，只能预留 + 削峰。</li>\n<li>无背压的系统必然以级联崩溃收场；有界队列 + 池隔离 + 优先级老化 + 幂等去重是四件套。</li>\n<li>降级方案必须在设计期定义，因为面单 DPI、PDF/A 等约束由承运商与合规规则决定，不能临场决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"吞吐、延迟与容量工程","id":"吞吐-延迟与容量工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"吞吐模型与小定律容量核算","id":"吞吐模型与小定律容量核算"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染延迟的分层预算与 p99 归因","id":"渲染延迟的分层预算与-p99-归因"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划与弹性伸缩","id":"容量规划与弹性伸缩"},{"level":2,"text":"背压、隔离与降级","id":"背压-隔离与降级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高并发生成管线架构与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/document-pdf-label-generation-engineering/scale-generation-pipeline-ops/generation-pipeline-architecture"},"next":{"title":"失败排查、成本与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/document-pdf-label-generation-engineering/scale-generation-pipeline-ops/failure-triage-cost-observability"}}